    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RS Org Chart MCP Tools + Google Sheets Review\n\nSet these n8n environment variables before activating:\n\nORGCHART_BASE_URL=https://tools.romega-solutions.com/org-chart\nORGCHART_API_KEY=<your API key>\nORGCHART_SHEET_CSV_URL=<published Google Sheet CSV URL>\nORGCHART_REVIEW_EMAIL=<review recipient email>\n\nActivate the workflow, then copy the production MCP URL from the MCP Server Trigger node. The daily Google Sheets review checks for differences and emails a summary. It does not auto-apply changes."
      },
